    "body": "LOGICAL_AGENT = DUNCAN\nROLE = TECH / INDEPENDENT QC\nASSIGNED_BY = JINGO\nOWNER = SPARX\nSTATE = ASSIGNED / INDEPENDENT VERIFICATION REQUIRED\n\n## SCOPE\nIndependently verify LESTER's mocked implementation of Tasks 1–6 for the ZERO-BUDGET LOCAL Agent Controller v0.\n\nApproved spec:\n`docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-26-zb-agent-controller-v0-design.md`\n\nApproved plan:\n`docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-26-zb-local-agent-controller-v0.md`\n\nImplementation branch:\n`agent-controller/v0-implementation`\n\nEXACT HEAD UNDER REVIEW:\n`7285aa76ee678b3059ec4db22b5b4fb193b131df`\n\nBASE = `main` / `e1961ecab0a715cd631f468d67ae2a17d26f599b`\n\nLESTER handoff evidence is in issue #47 comment `5427792246`.\n\n## HOLD\nTask 7 disposable ComfyUI smoke is BLOCKED until this QC verdict.\nNo production model download/configuration.\nNo live SALVADOR generation.\nNo merge.\n\n## REQUIRED INDEPENDENT CHECKS\n1. Checkout/inspect EXACT HEAD above; fail QC if head drift is not explicitly accounted for.\n2. Re-run from `agent-controller/`:\n   - `PYTHONPATH=src python -m pytest -q`\n   - `PYTHONPATH=src python -m compileall -q src`\n   Record exact output and exit status.\n3. Verify Tasks 1–6 line-by-line against the approved plan, not merely test count.\n4. Verify strict `ZB_AGENT_TASK_V0` parser and allowlist behavior.\n5. Verify state-machine law, especially:\n   - ASSIGNED != RUNNING\n   - STARTING_BACKEND != RUNNING\n   - RUNNING requires non-empty real/mock `prompt_id` evidence\n   - RESULT_READY only after image + metadata persistence\n6. Verify fixed-root local path boundary, traversal rejection, supported image validation, and no arbitrary issue-supplied filesystem paths.\n7. Verify GitHub CLI execution uses fixed argv / `shell=False`; issue text cannot become shell source.\n8. Verify missing/unauthed `gh` produces configuration failure and cannot fabricate RUNNING.\n9. Verify duplicate suppression/idempotency and single active SALVADOR GPU lock.\n10. Verify durable event formatting contains metadata only and does not leak image bytes/local arbitrary content.\n11. Verify mocked ComfyUI adapter contract and timeout/failure behavior.\n12. Verify no paid API/OpenAI path, no `OPENAI_API_KEY`, no production model dependency, no live ComfyUI invocation requirement in Tasks 1–6.\n13. Verify no writes to `zorr-blatt-runtime`, no merge/OWNER LOCK/runtime activation authority.\n14. Inspect changed-file scope from main to exact HEAD for unrelated mutations.\n\n## REQUIRED VERDICT FORMAT\nIf acceptable:\n\n```text\nDUNCAN_LOCAL_CONTROLLER_QC_COMPLETE\nVERDICT = PASS\nEXACT_HEAD = 7285aa76ee678b3059ec4db22b5b4fb193b131df\nTESTS = <exact fresh result>\nCOMPILE = <exact fresh result>\nPLAN_TASKS_1_6 = PASS\nSECURITY_BOUNDARY = PASS\nSTATE_EVIDENCE_LAW = PASS\nTASK_7 = AUTHORIZED_FOR_DISPOSABLE_SMOKE_ONLY\nOWNER_ACTION_REQUIRED = NO\n```\n\nIf not acceptable:\n\n```text\nDUNCAN_LOCAL_CONTROLLER_QC_COMPLETE\nVERDICT = CHANGES_REQUIRED\nEXACT_HEAD = 7285aa76ee678b3059ec4db22b5b4fb193b131df\nFINDINGS = <Critical/Important/Minor with exact file/line or test evidence>\nTASK_7 = BLOCKED\nOWNER_ACTION_REQUIRED = <YES|NO>\n```\n\nDo not accept LESTER's reported 48/48 as independent proof; reproduce it yourself.\n",
